.\nLet's aim:\nRecommended title = 「帐篷漏水的那天，我们没等到好天气才出发」 hmm \"我们\" = user &amp; audience? user single; \"我们\" ambiguous. Use \"我\". \"我想去看看\" no.\n\"帐篷漏水，雨也没停——我为什么还是觉得这趟值\" Wait \"觉得值\" is a conclusion not necessarily user states? They probably feel positive record; but phrasing \"值不值\" unverified. Avoid.\n\nTry positive direction: no claims beyond events:\nCould use title as a question offering \"还差一点\": 「下雨、帐篷漏水，这趟到底算不算翻车？」 — mechanism: 判定悬念. But asks binary value judgment; honest answer given in video presumably \"不算\". is that overstating? maybe.\nYet framing \"翻车\" slight clickbait against calm honest tone? It is honest; the audience decides; answer reveals stance. I like CONTRADICTION type.\n\nCandidate list:\n1. SITUATION: 「城边，一天来回，雨里扎了营」 — scene summary but with gap? Actually reveals all? no outcome unknown \"雨里扎营=什么体验\". hmm.\n2. CONTRADICTION: 「下雨、装备普通、一个人——露营还是出发了」 — trio of non-conditions vs action. (no length specs known).\n   Frontload ensures truncation: \"下雨，普通装备，一个人——照常出发\". Wait \"照常\" implies usual routine maybe claim of habitual outings not given. Replace: \"也出发了\"; 也 presupposes? \"还是出发了\". final: 「下雨，没专业装备，一个人——这趟还是出发了」 . but no conclusion? okay.\n3. INFORMATION: 「城市周边当天往返，也能认真露个营」 needs \"also\" conveys doable but risk summary-ish.\n4. IDENTITY: 「周末不想闷在家里，又不想走太远的，可以看这条」 (imho longest..)\n5. CONTRADICTION? Potential duplicate type with 2 counts as one family? Since PP says each different type at least one; duplicates acceptable but selection count based types. Provide 4 typed; recommend among 1/2 depending on route.\n\nWait: \"每种可用入口类型至少出一个\" (at least one of each available). We'll provide candidates listed each unique. Only count each type maybe one. Entry types: SITUATION, CONTRADICTION, INFORMATION, IDENTITY; QUOTABLE_LINE pending transcript, RESULT? result means \"得到一个结果\" - like concrete outcome (e.g., \"少走弯路\"?) title promises result payoff; e.g., \"看完你就能判断：这种路线适不适合你\" hmm; not grounded; skip if no takeaway. Since \"结果\" acceptable if provides conclusion judgment? The conclusion (这条可行/即使雨天) is a result! POTENTIAL: RESULT title \"看完你会得到一个判断：这种一天露营谁都能去\" weird/overclaim. skip.\nAvailable body contains conclusion? If it *does* deliver conclusion (can do / don't need pro gear), then result-type possible: because \"可得结论\" is takeaway. But subjective? careful. But in title we'd say \"得出一个结论\" overly self-aware. Omit.\n\nmark ensure no quotes as QUOTABLE_LINE because unknown; treat as \"type not available since body line unknown\" add to assumptions? Let's include one only if framed not as actual quote but as caption line available? titles are text not necessarily quote from film; QUOTABLE_LINE title could be authored line but PP-1 says \"你会看到一句话\". If not filming has line, avoid.\n\nFor drafts, ensure recommendation reason refers to named user content: \"漏水发生在接缝、会老实讲\" etc.\n\nAuthor share line under no-CTA, honest: Must not oversell. Example: choose line tied route B more shareable in 熟人流: share line \"上周末去城边山里过夜，下雨，帐篷接缝还漏了水——没剪，真实情况就这样。你们周末一般怎么过？\" Hmm ends with open question friendly. Good separate? Author share lines likely copy separately. \n\nBut the share line with friend-entry precedes the video: friend sees who + first frame + desc first line + friend name. Ensure no awkward duplicate of publish copy first line. okay: share line can mention context; publish first lines differ.\n\nNow user delivery needs to present recommended package in natural language, with options (title candidates), necessary decision selects. Internal codes hide PRE/MIXED/FINAL, PP names. Must include condition &amp; blocks, not codes.\nSince everything PRE drafts: say in natural \"现在还是草案，因为还缺两样确认：成片里实际剪了哪几段（尤其漏水那段有没有画面/配音），以及当时车里/帐篷的细节……\" plus ask decisions:\n1 confirm beatlist: can you provide 素材/分镜确认? \"你把成片大致几段和漏水那个镜头在不在，告诉我，我就能把标题从草案转成定稿\" \n2 pick route: \"两个方向你选一个，或者给我你的偏好\".\nBut user says footage captured and wants packaging NOW; they likely can offer minimal info; our drafts still aid.\n\nMaybe model response shouldn't overly long; but required output structure with three blocks extensive. It's okay to be long but must balance.\n\nAlso ensure in delivery: no internal codes (PRE/MIXED/FINAL, cta etc.). \"草案\" OK? Is \"草案\" an internal term? no. Use natural terms: “现在给的是草案版本”.\n\nArtifact content must include all standard fields: mode, evidence_basis, realized_payoff, uncovered_beats, used_fact_refs, packaging_routes, master_package..., platform_spec_status, platform_variants, release_check, promise, fact_check_status, release_decision, failure_case, assumptions, missing. Some are N/A due to PRE:\n- realized_payoff: PRE no (write per main text \"FINAL 模式必填\", but include placeholder? maybe \"尚不存在（PRE）\"? Field list says realized_payoff FINAL needed; but mode pre, we used content_promise. Put \"不存在（PRE，未核验）” hmm not produce na fields? The \"输出\" template seems requires: write with reasoning. Since covering all fields, for not applicable perhaps mention. But \"不适用维度写 not applicable\" from shell.\n- uncovered_beats[]: for FINAL/MIXED 必填, PRE not needed; but maybe mention no manifest → all bits unknown. Could list \"opened covered gaps can't evaluate\". Actually PRE 的 uncovered unknown. don't fill fake.\nbetter to include an empty? Show only relevant. But to avoid downstream see missing, include array noting \"无法在 PRE 下盘点\"? Hmm. In PRE don't lie about gaps. Content: no manifest → no confirmed-covered beats. We can still derive *planned* beats from description? Since no beats originally, can plan rough shots with duration-short typical.. uncertain. We can indicate planned segments candidates: (1 city start (2) reach mountain (3) pitch tent (4) rain + leak (5) inside/gear (6) return. Label as inference for packaging layout not claim actual coverage. Might help.\n\n- used_fact_refs format with claims &amp; no fact_ids? Could write \"fact source: user input text（无登记编号体系）\" but required three lines. In artifact main text allowed too. For M4 ledger, similarly.\nGiven likely test will