tion rules generic; still useful: big key words for silent playback: \"小雨/接缝/漏水/当天往返\" maybe.\n- sound_placement: \"接住导演包\" but none; actually PD output missing. We do not invent; but sound design around rain: use real rain ambience, music entry after leak reveal? main video likely voiceover; provide minimal direction: 保留现场雨声、不要压掉雨点声；漏水的描述处建议只留环境声不加配乐；如有人声 VO 保持清晰（风噪处理参考）? Could be practical notes not factual claims. domain mentions wind noise: 贴身录音等 ... This applies likely. However, need avoid overlong.\n- safe area for video号 unknown: conservative assumption top150 bottom300 left/right50 → keep captions inside this region; \"most conservative among three platforms\" set assumptions.\n\n- first_frame design: because SHORT ≤60, first seconds win; choose 1st shot among existing self-filmed material may be user set camera walking etc. We can't know. Better first frame principle: 画面信息 \"这里是城边山里；这趟是当天来回的露营计划\" via visual/caption. Since unknown, instruct: if footage begins with city drive etc use that; self-filmed setup likely needs captions to state context. Not claim specific shot existence.\n\nRecommend title should be like: `帐篷接缝漏了水，这趟我还是想发出来`? Wait \"想发出来\" gap meh.\nOr ask with answer felt:\n\"下着雨，帐篷接缝漏水——这趟露营算翻车吗？\"\nHonest title but maybe making failure question though in video says otherwise; and doesn't underline premise city/daytrip/noProgear. But that's what video's body narration covers. User said don't hype.\n\nAnother reason to route B: avoids promise \"可行/noequipment\" unsupported by beat entries; if final footage lacks clean demonstration. Safer for pack &amp; likely works. But user's prime \"想让观众知道可行\" not satisfied? Body could fulfill all while title catches emotion; after watching comes with feasibility. Great: recommended: Route \"真实记录\" title, delivery copy reinforces 可行性. Route two \"直接认证\". Distinguish.\n\nOK pack final pack route structure:\nRoute A — \"验证向：普通人也能走的一日露营\" \nmechanism: 指向“想去但怕麻烦/怕装备不够”的观众，用验证感降低行动门槛。\n失效条件: (a) 正片未呈现完整“普通装备完成当天往返”的