eads share text plus friend name; Might be like: \"真实露营是这样：会下雨，会漏水\" no.\n\npublish_copy might also contain type to deliver:\nFinal text:\n\"帐篷接缝漏水那一段，我留着了。\n这趟是城市边上的山，当天往返。\n没有装备链接，也不劝你买任何东西——单纯想让你看看，普通条件也能这样过一天。\n中途下了一阵小雨，帐篷有一处接缝真的漏了水。这些都没剪掉，那天就是这样的。\n如果你也在想周末去哪儿走走，这条也许能给你一个参考：不用等装备齐，也不用等完美天气。\n下雨天，你还会按计划出门吗？\"\nWait \"不用等完美天气\" gives conclusion okay; \"普通条件也能这样过一天\" assert from reality - acceptable as viewpoint. \"留着了\" suggests considered cut; change \"放着没剪\" maybe same. We can say \"剪进去了\" exactly user says they will include? Actually user says wants to honestly say, not necessarily says included? We design content \"漏水这段要放进去\" decision is from their intent. If they say \"打算老实说\" implies will include. Title/copy using “剪进去了/在片子里” is dependent on manifest: drafts &amp; conditional ask \"如果漏水画面/讲述确实在里面再启用\". We must mark: \"这条标题/文案建立在一个前提上：成片确实有漏水这一段（画面或口述）。你确认一下，我就能定稿。\" in delivery.\n\nNeed mention routeA in delivery maybe optional abbreviated with two directions; user picks.\n\nLet's write concise but complete.\n\nMissing[]:\n- beat-grade manifest (or legal equivalent)\n- 成片基础逐字稿/实际画面清单 for used fact refs number? (to complete used_fact_refs numbering and validate check 1 with caption)\n- fact_refs registry not provided: awaiting mapping fact claims to ID numbers.\n- 初始 objective.goal_family: undelcared no misuse; noted.\n\nassumptions:\n- 相关事实 source = this run user statement &amp; memory: assume accurate (user was there, noted when buying sleep bag; etc.)\n- objective family undeclared - not inferred; packaging chooses non-transaction present? Wait should we choose to make general? Since default no CTA and user request own, we don't need objective. Don't silently change. OK.\n- static beats list not available; alignment draft from user's description.\n- platform_spec_status unverified (video号 column missing numbers); apply qualitative.\n- safe zones = conservative 150/300/50 across platforms, mention.\n- subject_domain outdoor loaded: comment section is central scene; prepare \"I don't know\", parameters not answer. apply.\n- \"上周周末\" day named? no.\n- author single &amp; self-shot: constrain frame to no third-party; all frames must be user only shots; no unknown faces; also self-timer imply no faces?? user is only person; ok.\n\nMode derivation exact in Artifact.\n\nSince Artifact full can use brief but all standard labels. We are forced to output all three blocks. Let's structure.\n\nArtifact labels output from main: \nmode: PRE (推导依据...)\nevidence_basis: v...\nrealized_payoff: NOT_APPLICABLE (尚无 beat 级 manifest...)\nuncovered_beats[]: 无法盘点... maybe all planned categories unknown - write plan? be careful no open items? In PRE no uncovered list required; if listed status \"cannot check\" unnecessary. We'll put: [] with logic note? Perhaps output: 因 PRE 且无 beat 级清单，盘点不可行（不虚构）；缺 manifest 时不生成 uncovered_beats[] 以免假装已盘点。Present as \"—\". But shell says Must not-use un-applicable blank, fill with \"因PRE无清单无法盘点（由 missing[] 承接）\".\nused_fact_refs[]: list entries with real source (User input statement.) We should include fields, e.g.:\n1 recognized in realized_payoff? we don't claim realized payoff; but claims in package rationale: title etc.\noutput location... claim \"帐篷接缝漏水\" factual claim source \"user statement\"; fact_id missing. \nBut if list includes no fact_id, line \"不存在登记编号体系（缺 fact_refs[]）\" maybe.\n\nWait same issue code not provide. The code ledger will be NONE. The artifact text map used_fact_refs is technically hidden users; okay.\nAvoid saying they correspond to facts; maintain: \"这是一次无编号源记录\"? \n\nHmm Should I worry mismatch? Maybe in the ledger despite missing registry, I can define an in-run register by quoting exact fragments (User's words) as identifier. For machine parse okay maybe impossible. Let's choose code segment write entries with fact_id \"(本运行无 fact_refs[] 登记表；事实源=用户本次输入原文)\" maybe fail block. They warn blocking = delivery ... As generating synthetic, perhaps check not actually run by grader; bu