tually PRE mode cannot READY. But is HOLD proper? release_decision derived from release_check five lines etc. In PRE: release_check无法五条全核过（缺逐字核对、无manifest）、fact_check_status NOT_VERIFIED, missing[] non-empty effect publishability ⇒ release_decision = HOLD_FOR_FIX; user status NEEDS_DECISION. Even better: our user delivery can be drafts, delivery status NEEDS_DECISION due to missing inputs and choice. But artifact maybe release_decision=HOLD_FOR_FIX? In fact per \"PRE全标草案\" not necessarily requiring HOLD? It says mode PRE all output draft &amp; not verify payoff; release_check statuses: cannot fully pass → HOLD. OK.\n\nfact_check_status: Since claims sourced from user, no external registry; we can mark NOT_VERIFIED (not FAIL; no need to *block*, since nothing is disputed). Wait if NOT_VERIFIED, release_decision can't be READY; consistent HOLD. In PRE anyway.\n\nWait — if status NEEDS_DECISION vs BLOCKED_LOCAL: We have usable drafts; need user decisions (which route; confirm leak frame exists &amp; on-screen etc.), so NEEDS_DECISION.\n\nNow packaging for 视频号 specifics:\n- 社交带出 =&gt; author share line mandatory. Write author share line (natural): example: \"周末去城边过了个夜，下雨，帐篷还漏了一小段水，真实情况都剪进去了\" Hmm share line probably chosen by route. Keep simple; recommended based route B: \"下着小雨也出了一趟城边露营，帐篷漏水那段没剪掉\" — tells friends; make sure not promise too much. Or align to recommended title.\n- Video号第一眼 分两路; 描述第一行 critical; publish_copy first three lines standalone.\n\npublish_copy structure:\n- First 3 lines standalone: capture scene/promise + honest note.\n- Body: 片中没放进去的话 structure? PP-4 \"片子里没说的是...\" requires registered fact not used in the film. We don't know film contents → forbidden. So ordinary structure without that device; allowed: \"片子里没说的是\" not needed.\nDraft publish_copy: Placeholder-ish but useful. Use their contents:\nLine1: \"帐篷接缝漏水的那一小段，我剪进去了。\"\nLine2: \"这趟是城市边上的山里，当天往返。\"\nLine3: \"一个人去，没带特别装备，睡袋也是普通化纤的。\"\nBody text: intro message: no purchase link etc maybe not explicit. Wrap up: no CTA; end question that one-liner: \"下雨天你们还会按原计划出门吗？\"\nLonger body? 描述可能长度未知; keep in 3+short lines but okay drafts &amp; frontload.\n\nhashtags_topics: Not applicable per earlier: state NOT_APPLICABLE, give reason. Also if description doesn't need; do not add fake tags.\n\nWait platforms says 视频号 supports hashtag? Not in reference; leave NOT_APPLICABLE with explanation of missing (mechanism not loaded/ 不得凭记忆). Since user delivery must avoid internal terms; phrase \"标签：不加，本条不带话题（拿不准平台话题页的实际作用前不硬凑）\" hmm \"不硬凑\" acceptable natural. But note in userdelivery maybe not even mention tags, optional; in artifact state NOT_APPLICABLE.\n\nCover &amp; produce:\nVideo号 cover function low in feed; used profile grid &amp; share-out first scene. Cover design:\n- choose frame: tent with rain drop? or establishing location. Given no footage list: design guidance:\ncover frame: 户外绿色山谷/营地 wide shot + text: \"城市边上 · 当天往返\" (small) giant line maybe \"帐篷漏了水\" to trigger? WAIT needs division of labor with title. Let’s assign:\nRecommended packaging chosen route B→ but to optimize first two entrances on 视频号:\n- first_frame (on feed): 首帧: the early \"出发/到达\" showing location, geography: \"城郊山脚，普通周末\" to set context; 开头几秒到雨/旅程 (unknown order). Text first frame small: \"周六，多云转小雨\"? We don't know day? user said 上周末 relative could derive but we shouldn't state \"周六\" as fact (they said 上周末, so avoid). Text: \"城市边上 · 当天往返\" locational.\n- Title picks gap (\"……\" )\n- Cover (for profile/share) maybe a rain/tent detail proof image: shows the honest leak with text \"漏水也没剪掉\" — that plus title complement.\n\nPP-2 relation: 首帧 (location/地点) = 互补; 标题 (场景缺口) = 互补? Cover (proof) 证明.\nMaster package cover text levels: header big \"说好的露营，漏了水\" too jokey with negative. Let's finalize concrete recommend overall:\n\nRecommended title candidate? possibly `CONTRADICTION` or `SITUATION`: Given title must not reveal all. Which single title strongest and most aligned with intent &amp; authenticity? Top: 「不是好天气，也没用专业装备，这趟还是出发了」 too long/feeble.\nHonest-focus: 「帐篷接缝漏水的那次露营，我还是想发出来」 → strong; gap: 为什么想发? click to see. But implies value; user \"想老实说\". Another: 「城市边上过夜，下雨，帐篷漏了——但这趟我想说可行」 runs long. \nActually PP-1 suggests headline gap portion + cover context. \n\nLet's produce recommended_title: 「城边露营，下雨，帐篷接缝漏了水」 plus explicit non-promise? It still doesn't state the conclusion \"可行\"; body demonstrates that. feels SITUATION.\nBut the user's main point is proof feasible. In title, proving feasibility is hard without sounding adv. Maybe: 「真的不用专业装备——我们这趟当天往返」 eh.\nGiven the 取舍 exists; recommend Route? Let's reason: The distinctive emotional contract is honesty (versus typical camping content gloss). \"Feasibility\" as click motive is weaker/can induce advice-seekers &amp; then no guide -&gt; mismatch. The honest situation title promises \"see real flawed trip\", matches content 1:1. Feasibility message works as body support via share/comment. However an identity audience intent \"周末想出去又怕麻烦\" wants feasibility rather than drama.\n\nBut to compensate, choose \"hybrid\" exact recommended wording carrying both: 「下着雨、帐篷漏了水，我们也把城边露营过成了」? lacks gap.\nSuggestion: Title \"淋着雨也过完的一天\" not specific.\nLet's aim:\nRecommended title = 「帐篷漏水的那天，我们没等到好天气才出发」 hmm \"我们\" = user &amp; audience? user single; \"我们\" ambiguous. Use \"我\". \"我想去看看\" no.\n\"帐篷漏水，雨也没停——我为什么还是觉得这趟值\" Wait \"觉得值\" is a conclusion not necessarily user states? They probably feel positive record; but phrasing \"值不值\" unverified. Avoid.\n\nTry positive direction: no claims beyond events:\nCould use title as a question offering \"还差一点\": 「下雨、帐篷漏水，这趟到底算不算翻车？」 — mechanism: 判定悬念. But asks binary value judgment; honest answer given in video presumably \"不算\". is that overstating? maybe.\nYet framing \"翻车\" slight clickbait against calm honest tone? It is honest; the audience decides; answer reveals stance. I like CONTRADICTION type.\n\nCandidate list:\n1. SITUATION: 「城边，一天来回，雨里扎了营」 — scene summary but with gap? Actually reveals all? no outcome unknown \"雨里扎营=什么体验\". hmm.\n2. CONTRADICTION: 「下雨、装备普通、一个人——露营还是出发了」 — trio of non-conditions vs action. (no length specs known).\n   Frontload ensures truncation: \"下雨，普通装备，一个人——照常出发\". Wait \"照常\" implies usual routine maybe claim of habitual outings not given. Replace: \"也出发了\"; 也 presupposes? \"还是出发了\". final: 「下雨，没专业装备，一个人——这趟还是出发了」 . but no conclusion? okay.\n3. INFORMATION: 「城市周边当天往返，也能认真露个营」 needs \"also\" conveys doable but risk summary-ish.\n4. IDENTITY: 「周末不想闷在家里，又不想走太远的，可以看这条」 (imho longest..)\n5. CONTRADICTION? Potential duplicate type with 2 counts as one family? Since PP says each different type at least one; duplicates acceptable but selection count based types. Provide 4 typed; recommend among 1/2 depending on route.\n\nWait: \"每种可用入口类型至少出一个\" (at least one of each available). We'll provide candidates listed each unique. Only count each type maybe one. Entry types: SITUATION, CONTRADICTION, INFORMATION, IDENTITY; QUOTABLE_LINE pending transcript, RESULT? result means \"得到一个结果\" - like concrete outcome (e.g., \"少走弯路\"?) title promises result payoff; e.g., \"看完你就能判断：这种路线适不适合你\" hmm; not grounded; skip if no takeaway. Since \"结果\" acceptable if provides conclusion judgment? The conclusion (这条可行/即使雨天) is a result! POTENTIAL: RESULT title \"看完你会得到一个判断：这种一天露营谁都能去\" weird/overclaim. skip.\nAvailable body contains conclusion? If it *does* deliver conclusion (can do / don't need pro gear), then result-type possible: because \"可得结论\" is takeaway. But subjective? careful. But in title we'd say \"得出一个结论\" overly self-aware. Omit.\n\nmark ensure no quotes as QUOTABLE_LINE because unknown; treat as \"type not available since body line unknown\" add to assumptions? Let's include one only if framed not as actual quote but as caption line available? titles are text not necessarily quote from film; QUOTABLE_LINE title could be authored line but PP-1 says \"你会看到一句话\". If not filming has line, avoid.\n\nFor drafts, ensure recommendation reason refers to named user content: \"漏水发生在接缝、会老实讲\" etc.\n\nAuthor share line under no-CTA, honest: Must not oversell. Example: choose line tied route B more shareable in 熟人流: share line \"上周末去城边山里过夜，下雨，帐篷接缝还漏了水——没剪，真实情况就这样。你们周末一般怎么过？\" Hmm ends with open question friendly. Good separate? Author share lines likely copy separately. \n\nBut the share line with friend-entry precedes the video: friend sees who + first frame + desc first line + friend name. Ensure no awkward duplicate of publish copy first line. okay: share line can mention context; publish first lines differ.\n\nNow user delivery needs to present recommended package in natural language, with options (title candidates), necessary decision selects. Internal codes hide PRE/MIXED/FINAL, PP names. Must include condition &amp; blocks, not codes.\nSince everything PRE drafts: say in natural \"现在还是草案，因为还缺两样确认：成片里实际剪了哪几段（尤其漏水那段有没有画面/配音），以及当时车里/帐篷的细节……\" plus ask decisions:\n1 confirm beatlist: can you provide 素材/分镜确认? \"你把成片大致几段和漏水那个镜头在不在，告诉我，我就能把标题从草案转成定稿\" \n2 pick route: \"两个方向你选一个，或者给我你的偏好\".\nBut user says footage captured and wants packaging NOW; they likely can offer minimal info; our drafts still aid.\n\nMaybe model response shouldn't overly long; but required output structure with three blocks extensive. It's okay to be long but must balance.\n\nAlso ensure in delivery: no internal codes (PRE/MIXED/FINAL, cta etc.). \"草案\" OK? Is \"草案\" an internal term? no. Use natural terms: “现在给的是草案版本”.\n\nArtifact content must include all standard fields: mode, evidence_basis, realized_payoff, uncovered_beats, used_fact_refs, packaging_routes, master_package..., platform_spec_status, platform_variants, release_check, promise, fact_check_status, release_decision, failure_case, assumptions, missing. Some are N/A due to PRE:\n- realized_payoff: PRE no (write per main text \"FINAL 模式必填\", but include placeholder? maybe \"尚不存在（PRE）\"? Field list says realized_payoff FINAL needed; but mode pre, we used content_pr